# Pulled Snowflake extracts — regenerate with `uv run python pull_data.py`.
# Kept out of the repo because text_samples.parquet alone is ~112MB of raw
# passage text, and the root .gitignore's `data/**/*` rule is anchored to the
# repo root so it does not cover this directory.
data/
assets/fonts/

# Machine-generated vector copies of the figures: ~400KB of unreviewable XML
# each, and 95% of the diff. Regenerate with `uv run --script viz.py`.
figures/*.svg
